        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Textile fragment of woven silk and silver gilt strip. Braid woven in cream and yellow silk, and yellow silk wound with silver gilt strip. The pattern is of three strips of basket weave with silver gilt thread, divided by strips where this thread is floated over the silk foundation. Possibly an original covering from the throne of Napoleon I."@en ;
